## Command

```shell
biome lint --write --only=noVueNegationElse file.vue
```

## `biome.json`

```json
{
  "html": {
    "linter": { "enabled": true },
    "experimentalFullSupportEnabled": true
  }
}
```

## `file.vue`

```vue
<template>
  <section v-if="outer" class="outer-else">
    <span v-if="!nested" class="nested-if">Nested if</span>
    <p v-else class="nested-else">Nested else</p>
  </section>
  <div v-else class="outer-if">
    <span v-if="!inner" class="inner-if">Inner if</span>
    <p v-else class="inner-else">Inner else</p>
  </div>
  <div v-if="a === b">Equal</div>
  <div v-else>Not equal</div>
</template>

```

# Emitted Messages

```block
Checked 1 file in <TIME>. Fixed 1 file.
```
